(VERO360 LIMITED) Tj
T*
(Car Hire Service Policy  |  Version 1.0  |  Draft for CEO approval) Tj
T*
(Reg. No. COY-J7RCG5G  |  TPIN 71241378  |  Area 14, Lilongwe, Malawi) Tj
T*
(info@vero360.app  |  www.vero360.app  |  0888 367 037 / +265 887 261 094) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(KEY POINTS AT A GLANCE) Tj
T*
(Role of Vero360  Facilitator only. No vehicles are owned, insured or operated by Vero360.) Tj
T*
(Who can list  Verified Vehicle Partners with a roadworthy, insured vehicle and proof of ownership or authority.) Tj
T*
(Who can book  Verified Renters. Self-drive requires a valid driving licence for the class of vehicle.) Tj
T*
(Pricing  Set by the Vehicle Partner. Vero360 commission is added on top, never deducted.) Tj
T*
(Payment  In-app only, through PawaPay. Payments outside the App are not protected.) Tj
T*
(Security deposit  Held by Vero360 and returned after the Trip unless a substantiated claim is lodged.) Tj
T*
(Handover and return  Photo Condition Report on both occasions, and GPS-tied trip start.) Tj
T*
(Accidents  Report at once to the police where required, to the Vehicle Partner and to Vero360 in the App.) Tj
T*
(Disputes  Reviewed by Vero360 on the evidence recorded in the App.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PURPOSE AND SCOPE) Tj
T*
(This Policy sets out how the Car Hire service on the Vero360 App operates. Vero360 is a technology) Tj
T*
(platform and facilitator only. Vero360 does not own, lease, operate, maintain or insure any vehicle) Tj
T*
(listed on the App, and does not employ any Driver. This Policy forms part of the Platform User) Tj
T*
(Agreement and the Merchant Agreement. On a car-hire matter, this Policy prevails.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
