(2. DEFINITIONS) Tj
T*
(Vehicle Partner  An individual or business that lists one or more vehicles and has been verified.) Tj
T*
(Renter  A person who books a vehicle through the Vero360 App.) Tj
T*
(Driver  The Renter \(Self-Drive\) or a driver supplied by the Vehicle Partner \(With Driver\).) Tj
T*
(Self-Drive  The Renter, or an approved additional driver, drives the vehicle.) Tj
T*
(With Driver  The Vehicle Partner supplies a verified driver.) Tj
T*
(Security Deposit  An amount held by Vero360 against damage, fines, fuel shortfall or other loss.) Tj
T*
(Condition Report  The photographic and written record at handover and at return.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. NATURE OF THE SERVICE) Tj
T*
(Vero360 operates a marketplace that connects Vehicle Partners with Renters. Two rental modes are) Tj
T*
(offered: Self-Drive and With Driver. Each listing states which mode or modes the Partner offers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. ELIGIBILITY AND VERIFICATION) Tj
T*
(Vehicle Partners need identification, proof of ownership or authority, business registration and TPIN) Tj
T*
(where required, and a payout account in their own name. Self-drive Renters must hold a valid licence) Tj
T*
(for the class of vehicle. With-Driver drivers must hold a professional or appropriate licence and pass) Tj
T*
(identity and background verification.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. VEHICLE STANDARDS) Tj
T*
(Every listed vehicle must be roadworthy, insured for hire and reward, clean, mechanically sound, and) Tj
T*
(fitted with working seat belts, lights, tyres, spare, jack, spanner and warning triangle. Expired) Tj
T*
(documents suspend the listing until renewal is verified.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
