(6-9. BOOKING, PRICING, DEPOSIT, CANCELLATION) Tj
T*
(A Booking is confirmed once the Renter accepts this Policy and the Platform User Agreement and pays) Tj
T*
(in the App. The Rental Charge is set by the Partner. Commission is added on top. Funds are released) Tj
T*
(after verified trip end and the return Condition Report. Late return without an approved extension is) Tj
T*
(charged at 1.5 times the hourly equivalent after a 60-minute grace.) Tj
T*
(The Security Deposit is collected at Booking, held by Vero360, and returned within 3 working days) Tj
T*
(unless a claim is lodged. It is always refunded in full on cancellation.) Tj
T*
(Renter cancellation: more than 48 hours, full refund; 24-48 hours, 50% of the rental charge; less) Tj
T*
(than 24 hours or no-show, no rental refund. Partner cancellation: full refund to the Renter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(10. HANDOVER, USE AND RETURN) Tj
T*
(Both parties complete the Condition Report before the trip starts. The trip starts only when the App) Tj
T*
(records GPS at the agreed handover point. Return the same fuel level unless the listing states) Tj
T*
(otherwise. The return report is completed within 30 minutes of arrival.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(11. PERMITTED AND PROHIBITED USE) Tj
T*
(Only the named Driver or an extra driver approved in the App may drive. Prohibited: drink or drugs,) Tj
T*
(sub-letting, taxi or courier use without consent, racing, off-road unless listed, illegal goods,) Tj
T*
(travel outside Malawi unless listed, smoking or animals unless listed, and tracker tampering.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
