(12-14. INSURANCE, CLAIMS, SAFETY) Tj
T*
(Vero360 does not provide motor insurance. The Partner must keep valid hire-and-reward cover on the) Tj
T*
(App. Accidents must be reported to the police where required, then to the Partner and Vero360 within) Tj
T*
(2 hours. Fines, tolls and parking charges during a trip are the Renter's. Damage claims must be) Tj
T*
(lodged within 48 hours of trip end with the Condition Reports and photographs.) Tj
T*
(All Drivers drive safely, obey the Road Traffic Act and wear seat belts. With-Driver conduct includes) Tj
T*
(punctuality, respect and no alcohol or drugs on duty.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(15-17. PLATFORM INTEGRITY, DATA, DISPUTES) Tj
T*
(Contact details are not shared at booking. Off-platform rentals to avoid commission are a breach.) Tj
T*
(Vero360 processes personal data under the Data Protection Act, 2024. GPS data is used for safety,) Tj
T*
(recovery and disputes only. Complaints are acknowledged within 1 working day and aimed to be) Tj
T*
(resolved within 7 working days. Disputes are decided on App evidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(18-20. SUSPENSION, ROLE OF VERO360, LAW) Tj
T*
(Vero360 may suspend a listing or account for safety risk, fraud, falsified documents or repeated) Tj
T*
(breaches. Vero360 is not the owner, hirer, operator, employer or insurer of any vehicle or trip,) Tj
T*
(except where the law provides otherwise. This Policy is governed by the laws of Malawi.) Tj
T*
(Questions: info@vero360.app or 0888 367 037 / +265 887 261 094.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
